---
description: Global page backgrounds and surfaces
globs:
  - "src/app/**/*.tsx"
  - "src/app/custom-style.css"
  - "src/**/*.css"
alwaysApply: false
---

## Page backgrounds
- Light mode: solid white or neutral-50. No gradients.
- Dark mode: solid #0a0a0a or black. No gradients.
- Never apply radial or linear gradients to a page-level container.
- Gradients are allowed only on small elements (buttons, badges,
  hover states), never full-page.

## Surfaces that need distinction from the page
Use borders and elevation, not background tint:
- Cards: bg-white dark:bg-neutral-900
- Borders: border-neutral-200 dark:border-white/10
